invariant: INV-16
file: aead.c
catches: widemul_runtime_test
reason: the AEAD's Poly1305 final runs under CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED whatever
  answer the seal or open was handed. The tag is the same.
  bin/widemul_runtime_test requires the AEAD to call the native copies
  alone under the constant-time answer.

--- old
    widemul_poly1305_final(widemul, &p, tag);
--- new
    widemul_poly1305_final(CH_WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED, &p, tag);
